{"id":"cc78339b84b14c7b","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-strong-representation.md","title":"Strong Representation","display":"df-strong-representation — Strong Representation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-strong-representation","aliases":["90-df-strong-representation"],"display":"df-strong-representation — Strong Representation","depends_on":["[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-strong-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-strong-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strong-representation — Strong Representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Graph}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Graph}(f)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a> 的平铺数值图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!\">\\(\\exists!\\)</span>、有序变量列表和全称量词列取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>，无捕获代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x,y\">\\(\\vec x,y\\)</span> 两两不同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；公式的指定变量顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x,y\">\\(\\vec x,y\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (arithmetical theory)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S}^{(k+1)}\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S}^{(k+1)}\\)</span> (graph formula)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}_T\\)</span> (relation-representability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\\)</span> (strong function-representability predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_S\">\\(\\mathcal P\\in\\mathrm{Pres}_S\\)</span>，以下附加式给出原同名接口在证明呈示上的类型化调用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pres}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Pres}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>。原句子集参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的定义不变。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}representation}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(f,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{Graph}(f),\\varphi)\\land\nT\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists!y\\;\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strong\\text{-}representation}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(f,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{Graph}(f),\\varphi)\\land\nT\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists!y\\;\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_{\\mathcal P}(f,\\varphi)\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{StrongRep}_{\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)}(f,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{StrongRep}_{\\mathcal P}(f,\\varphi)\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{StrongRep}_{\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)}(f,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}\\)</span> : 强表示</li>\n<li>强函数表示在逐数表示其图像之外，还要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 内部证明每个输入存在唯一输出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本书特意采用较强的“对象理论统一证明存在唯一”条件。它不同于仅表示函数图，也不同于对每个标准输入分别可证唯一值；本次不因它比常用约定强而修改 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Graph}(f)$ 取 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的平铺数值图；$\\exists!$、有序变量列表和全称量词列取 [[90-df-formula]]，无捕获代入取 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b278