}representation}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(f,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{Graph}(f),\\varphi)\\land\nT\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists!y\\;\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_{\\mathcal P}(f,\\varphi)\\longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{StrongRep}_{\\operatorname{Ax}(\\mathcal P)}(f,\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongRep}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T","display":false}],"bytes":2160,"backlinks":[{"id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T$ (strong function-representability predicate, see [[90-df-strong-representation]])"},{"id":"7eb380164954dfb8","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongRep}_G$ (strong function-representability predicate, see [[90-df-strong-representation]])"},{"id":"f93e27fe7f2babaf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"235a1528abe157b8","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"保留原来的图关系表示结论。它不宣称 $T$ 统一证明 $\\forall x,y\\exists!z\\,\\vartheta_{\\mathrm{Sub}}$；后者是 [[90-df-strong-representation]] 的额外要求。例子必须写 $\\mathrm{Sub}_S(g(P(v)),0)=g(P[\\overline0/v])$，不能用已表示截断减法的 $\\mathrm{sub}$ 代替代入函数，也不能把二元对角限制 $\\operatorname{diag}$ 与本书 $D$ 混成同一元数。"},{"id":"d67f3eb689bf34b7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-strong-representation]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]